  "text": "This smart tool auto-declines conflicting calendar meetings and sets Slack to do-not-disturb automatically. When anyone can book open slots, your afternoon collapses into back-to-back calls with zero execution time. Declining meeting invites manually causes friction and guilt, so people accept syncs they never needed. Clockwise intelligently shifts flexible internal meetings, defends focus blocks, and syncs Slack statuses automatically. This saves you ten hours each week for high-leverage work.",
